<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Do you long for His presence?</l><l>Do you know His intention</l><l>Is to make us just the same as He?</l><l>And to love Him constantly?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Will you be a loving seeker?</l><l>Not a poor, dead law keeper?</l><l>We can read His word day by day,</l><l>Infuse us Lord, we pray.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
